input.command:
cd /private/var/folders/6g/0fzvn88n34q8hbxh7l32npfc0000gn/T/skillshed-bench-expo-release-off-3-owefMi
cat > eas.json <<'EOF'
{
  "cli": {
    "version": ">= 12.0.0",
    "appVersionSource": "remote"
  },
  "build": {
    "development": {
      "developmentClient": true,
      "distribution": "internal"
    },
    "preview": {
      "distribution": "internal",
      "android": {
        "buildType": "apk"
      }
    },
    "production": {
      "autoIncrement": true
    }
  },
  "submit": {
    "production": {
      "ios": {
        "ascAppId": "TODO_REPLACE_WITH_APP_STORE_CONNECT_APP_ID"
      },
      "android": {
        "serviceAccountKeyPath": "./secrets/google-play-service-account.json",
        "track": "production",
        "releaseStatus": "draft"
      }
    }
  }
}
EOF
python3 - <<'EOF'
import json
p='app.json'; d=json.load(open(p)); e=d['expo']
e['ios'].pop('buildNumber'); e['ios']['config']={'usesNonExemptEncryption': False}
a=e['android']; a.pop('versionCode')
e['android']={'package':'com.acmeapps.tidy', **a}
json.dump(d,open(p,'w'),indent=2); open(p,'a').write('\n')
EOF
printf '\n# Google Play service account key (used by eas submit)\nsecrets/\n' >> .gitignore
cat >> README.md <<'EOF'

## Releasing

Store builds use EAS: `eas build --profile production --auto-submit`.

Build numbers (iOS `buildNumber`, Android `versionCode`) are managed remotely by EAS and
auto-incremented on every production build; don't add them to `app.json`. Bump the
user-facing `version` in `app.json` for each new release.

Before the first release, fill in:

- `submit.production.ios.ascAppId` in `eas.json`: the numeric Apple ID of the app in
  App Store Connect (App Information → Apple ID).
- `secrets/google-play-service-account.json`: the Google Play service account key. It is
  gitignored; never commit it.

Google Play only accepts API uploads once the app exists in Play Console and a first build
has been uploaded manually. Android submissions go to the production track as a draft;
roll them out from Play Console.
EOF
